      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تمادحوا</span></b>  <i>They praised, eulogized,</i> or <i>commended, one another.</i> (A.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التَّمَادُحُ التَّذَابُحُ</span>
<i>Praising one another is slaughtering one another.</i>
(S, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذبح</span>, A.)

